 elliptical epidermal incision  and approaches to within 1 0cm of the inferior margin  4 0cm of the deep inked margin  8 0cm of the superior margin  10 3cm of the medial margin  and 11 2cm of the lateral margin  In addition  a cystic  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm cavity filled with red tan grumous material and surrounded by a rim of intense fibrosis and semifirm sulfur yellow discoloration is located immediately subjacent to the well healed vertical scar previously described and approaches to within 2 0cm of the inferior margin  2 5cm of the deep inked margin  7 0cm of the superior margin  7 0cm of the lateral margin  and 12 4cm of the medial margin  The remainder of the breast parenchyma consists of mature  lobular  yellow adipose tissue with intercolating thin  fibrous bands  The axillary tail is explored for lymph nodes  several lymph nodes are identified  Section Code  A  recent biopsy cavity and inferior margin  B  deep inked margin overlying recent biopsy cavity  C E  recent biopsy cavity  F  nipple  G  remote biopsy cavity and inferior margin  H  deep inked margin overlying remote biopsy cavity  I  remote biopsy cavity and scar  J K  remote biopsy cavity  L  low nodes  M O  middle nodes  P  high nodes  Resident  JAMES J  TIESINGA  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART   LEFT MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Yes.
