ece is submitted entirety in J K  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  additional shave margin superior cavity right breast  are multiple fragments of tan yellow fatty tissue measuring in aggregate REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  The specimen is inked in black and submitted in toto in L N  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  additional shaver margin inferior cavity right breast  are multiple fragments of tan yellow fibrofatty tissue measuring in aggregate REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  All of the tissue fragment are inked in black  The smaller fragments are submitted in toto in O  The larger fragments are serially sectioned to reveal a tan white fibrous parenchyma which is submitted entirety in P Q  Resident  JOHN BISSONNETTE  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  RIGHT BREAST MASS  EXCISION   INFILTRATING CARCINOMA NEAR OR AT THE MARGIN  O R  Resident  HONGMEI LI  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Andrew Eric Rosenberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST RIGHT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  RIGHT DEEP MARGIN   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART C  BREAST  RIGHT SUPERIOR MARGIN   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART D  BREAST  RIGHT INFERIOR MARGIN   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , No.
